            {
                "entry_id": "f9c97218-1643-329f-9059-525d2bcfb4a7",
                "word": "mansuétude",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0c9124d0-d6f3-40ab-ae95-97e1f8d1e075",
                        "entry_id": "f9c97218-1643-329f-9059-525d2bcfb4a7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "mansuétudes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                        "entry_id": "f9c97218-1643-329f-9059-525d2bcfb4a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Douceur d’âme qui porte à être indulgent, patient, clément."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "690b9e6a-4c61-496c-a3be-d5bd45a6e174",
                                "sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                                "text": "Il portait soixante ans, et c’était assurément un noble vieillard, à la physionomie pleine de mansuétude et de fierté."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd66fcd5-b5bb-45bd-b1f5-2ab26ba6ad57",
                                "sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                                "text": "Cependant, le caractère vraiment ornemental et architectural des armoiries, qui ne tolérait pas une représentation des objets sous leur forme parfaitement naturelle, se conserva […] jusqu’au milieu du XVIᵉ [siècle]. Depuis, les bonnes traditions allèrent s’affaiblissant, jusqu’au XIXᵉ qui a été témoin de la décadence complète de cet art vénérable, dont il semble qu’on eût oublié même les principes les plus élémentaires. Les armoiries qui offrirent le spectacle écœurant de lions pleins de mansuétude dont l’attitude chancelante fit supposer qu’ils étaient pris de vin, de sauvages minés par la phtisie ou bien se pavanant en petits-maîtres sauf le costume, d’aigles à l’air de serins de canarie, de casques en forme de melon ou de bonnet de nuit, inondèrent le monde."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "148bfcc2-9aac-47e3-8c8d-22f7296836cc",
                                "sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                                "text": "Par une inconcevable mansuétude, Elle avait toléré l’affront des fêtes décadaires, l’outrage de la déesse Raison vautrée sur l’autel à sa place […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3f114e5-fb20-4844-a8af-8123808559e5",
                                "sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                                "text": "D’autre part, cette mansuétude et cette bonté vraiment chrétiennes lui avaient assis, parmi les ouailles, une solide réputation de brave et d’honnête homme […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56523189-ae62-4ae6-8e45-7a9e45f1c987",
                                "sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                                "text": "Le souci de venger un outrage est considéré comme un mobile honorable, qui conduit naturellement les juges à la mansuétude."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72a23edb-92a0-464f-b220-c1c6a5d3403e",
                                "sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                                "text": "Ce qui m’étonne, c’est la mansuétude des Naturels (tibétains) qui n’ont pas massacré ces intrus mal élevés."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eea2cfef-70f1-4e72-9f5a-0248b08e7a76",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9c97218-1643-329f-9059-525d2bcfb4a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                        "target_lang_word": "Milde",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Milde",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4b2f53b-e856-3ab6-9f16-7f076736ad50",
                                        "entry_id": "bad4b1c9-2fd8-32fe-adbc-c3b17efcd5bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die Charaktereigenschaft der Sanftmut"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39018ffd-381b-456d-bcdd-85f35626b106",
                                                "sense_id": "c4b2f53b-e856-3ab6-9f16-7f076736ad50",
                                                "text": "Auffällig unter lauter Fanatikern war seine Milde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5122189c-b74a-48c1-971a-26ef55e38fe3",
                                                "sense_id": "c4b2f53b-e856-3ab6-9f16-7f076736ad50",
                                                "text": "„Seine Frömmigkeit wird durch zahlreiche Andachtsübungen bezeugt, und seine Milde zeigt sich darin, daß er die Begnadigung des Generals Debelle durchsetzte, der die Waffen gegen ihn erhoben hatte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cec2cb08-2be5-3465-8b51-efa48ff67312",
                                        "entry_id": "bad4b1c9-2fd8-32fe-adbc-c3b17efcd5bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die Eigenschaft von Speisen und Getränken, keine Reizstoffe zu enthalten (nicht scharf, gewürzt, salzig oder hochalkoholisch zu sein)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e10b2568-1c17-43e4-8b8b-114d302266e6",
                                                "sense_id": "cec2cb08-2be5-3465-8b51-efa48ff67312",
                                                "text": "Die Milde der warmen Milch beruhigte seine Magenschmerzen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Milde",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6af1802-00a6-3e3a-9112-60ae82cf10a0",
                                        "entry_id": "60ab217f-03db-3b1b-9166-e2295a2ea484",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "einen Fluss in Deutschland, Nebenfluss der Elbe und Teilabschnitt des Flusslaufs Milde-Biese-Aland"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "052dedcf-2af8-49db-84ac-6deeb7621151",
                                                "sense_id": "d6af1802-00a6-3e3a-9112-60ae82cf10a0",
                                                "text": "Kalbe liegt an der Milde."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f142bafd-8a56-46d6-8c27-50e2af17a245",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9c97218-1643-329f-9059-525d2bcfb4a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nachgiebigkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nachgiebigkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6716b9eb-2ea5-3197-b6d8-7d0f8bf50f26",
                                        "entry_id": "0d9cb98a-67cf-320c-bc93-e78c67919fd2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eigenschaft von Gegenständen, sich auf Druck hin zu verformen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cc08491-1829-31d9-b8d5-c6fa2c14ea0b",
                                        "entry_id": "0d9cb98a-67cf-320c-bc93-e78c67919fd2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "psychische Verfasstheit, auch mal auf Durchsetzung von Prinzipien, Wünschen oder dergleichen zu verzichten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1683540e-85ab-44dd-abb4-e64f34ff044a",
                                                "sense_id": "6cc08491-1829-31d9-b8d5-c6fa2c14ea0b",
                                                "text": "„Er war immer freundlich zu mir gewesen, und wenn er einmal ungerecht war, dann immer aus Nachgiebigkeit und zu meinem Besten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04fda05e-7cd2-433c-878a-416e6162fac0",
                                                "sense_id": "6cc08491-1829-31d9-b8d5-c6fa2c14ea0b",
                                                "text": "„Der Marchese triumphierte, und Veronica zeigte sich erfreut über meine Nachgiebigkeit.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "877b6921-71d7-4444-a638-45a45dafa8e0",
                                                "sense_id": "6cc08491-1829-31d9-b8d5-c6fa2c14ea0b",
                                                "text": "„Er hatte eine Natur, die alle Falten mit der zärtlichen Nachgiebigkeit eines schönen Samtstoffes annahm und behielt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c120d79-783e-4d70-9a4b-4d3e6c4130a5",
                                                "sense_id": "6cc08491-1829-31d9-b8d5-c6fa2c14ea0b",
                                                "text": "„Sie spürte seine Nachgiebigkeit und seinen Unglauben; es waren die Spinngewebe, die sie wieder umwickeln und lähmen wollten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d85bc348-92f0-4aaf-9dbb-b95fcffcdc96",
                                                "sense_id": "6cc08491-1829-31d9-b8d5-c6fa2c14ea0b",
                                                "text": "„Solche Nachgiebigkeit begünstige die Unordnung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a5ed94e-a900-442c-917b-f0f5563f8c99",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9c97218-1643-329f-9059-525d2bcfb4a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec390c86-dce1-3364-97c3-0dc93a43b617",
                        "target_lang_word": "indulgence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "indulgence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2af7c62-bda0-37ab-b71e-b7ed04683c6d",
                                        "entry_id": "5fc04c75-22ed-3dde-ba4a-6f92c97872df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of indulging."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee05d9a9-f984-4c1a-a8d8-a49ec84897cd",
                                                "sense_id": "b2af7c62-bda0-37ab-b71e-b7ed04683c6d",
                                                "text": "will all they that either through indulgence to others or fondness to any sin in themselves, substitute for repentance any thing that is less than a sincere, uniform resolution of new obedience"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b14d8dee-a0d7-4081-8145-c8373f116e66",
                                                "sense_id": "b2af7c62-bda0-37ab-b71e-b7ed04683c6d",
                                                "text": "As indulgence in several wives depended mainly on the length of a man's purse, the poor naturally contented themselves with monogamy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7b681e8-86fc-3c31-acee-e8997e9c5cf3",
                                        "entry_id": "5fc04c75-22ed-3dde-ba4a-6f92c97872df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tolerance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a89d3b46-0bc9-38d9-9ef8-97458048ffdb",
                                        "entry_id": "5fc04c75-22ed-3dde-ba4a-6f92c97872df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of catering to someone's every desire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a710e722-cb7c-3cac-a1e7-0e586a5523e4",
                                        "entry_id": "5fc04c75-22ed-3dde-ba4a-6f92c97872df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wish or whim satisfied."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c43093d6-1e33-4e50-be4e-22342fce7cd7",
                                                "sense_id": "a710e722-cb7c-3cac-a1e7-0e586a5523e4",
                                                "text": "\"In other words, the ONLY indulgences we'll be getting for a while is fixing your wardrobe. This means no new manga. No new games. Nothing. Get used to it.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f22bedd-f277-38ac-9c14-6cc28751430a",
                                        "entry_id": "5fc04c75-22ed-3dde-ba4a-6f92c97872df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something in which someone indulges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8704547-99df-43e7-9719-6bc46673ff5a",
                                                "sense_id": "6f22bedd-f277-38ac-9c14-6cc28751430a",
                                                "text": "I made but one error—giving way to petulance in the earlier instance; that lost me the Prince of Conti. Temper is bourgeois indulgence, though I own to a predilection for it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29cdf0d8-2125-3ce1-989f-1678d0d3e10e",
                                        "entry_id": "5fc04c75-22ed-3dde-ba4a-6f92c97872df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An indulgent act; a favour granted; gratification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43a89188-b5a7-48f9-b7f3-b6d5568afcf1",
                                                "sense_id": "29cdf0d8-2125-3ce1-989f-1678d0d3e10e",
                                                "text": "If all these gracious indulgences are without any effect on us, we must perish in our own folly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23177a1f-32af-30bd-84e0-bb4c74d19799",
                                        "entry_id": "5fc04c75-22ed-3dde-ba4a-6f92c97872df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pardon or release from the expectation of punishment in purgatory, after the sinner has been granted absolution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "237ec1c2-ae11-4ed7-a891-a5207bdb02b6",
                                                "sense_id": "23177a1f-32af-30bd-84e0-bb4c74d19799",
                                                "text": "To understand how indulgences were intended to work depends on linking together a number of assumptions about sin and the afterlife, each of which individually makes considerable sense."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "indulgence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2caeaf42-49c3-3f57-b191-3d3db3ce8b01",
                                        "entry_id": "a30ac2a1-682d-3596-8609-8ee522e13845",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "to provide with an indulgence"
                                        ],
